OL,3,GNEWSA'Facing collective blame' or 'no
OL,4,Aworse than being another minority':
OL,5,ABeing Jewish in Ireland
OL,6,
OL,7,FNaomi Handler has called Ireland home
OL,8,Ffor two decades.
OL,10,FShe's among the estimated 2,000 Jewish
OL,11,Fpeople living in the country - but has
OL,12,Fquestioned her place in it over the
OL,13,Fpast three years.
OL,15,FA mezuzah, a parchment scroll with a
OL,16,Fprayer from the Torah, common in Jewish
OL,17,Fhomes, hangs by her front door. "Should
OL,18,FI remove it?" she asks.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
