OL,3,GNEWSA'Facing collective blame' or 'no
OL,4,Aworse than being another minority':
OL,5,ABeing Jewish in Ireland
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe is one of a number of Jews who say
OL,8,Ftheir experiences of life in the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland have changed since
OL,10,Fthe war in Gaza began.
